<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Scrub It Out! Erasing Sensitive Memorization in Code Language Models via Machine Unlearning</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>2026 IEEE/ACM 48th International Conference on Software Engineering; April 12–18, 2026; Rio de Janeiro, Brazil</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">2026 IEEE/ACM 48th International Conference on Software Engineering (ICSE ’26), April 12–18, 2026, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3744916.3764573">10.1145/3744916.3764573</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-2025-3/26/04</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Software and its engineering Software development techniques</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Security and privacy</span></span></span>
